<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">T<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">2</sup>Agent: A Tool-augmented Multimodal Misinformation Detection Agent with Monte Carlo Tree Search</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Xing Cui
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
