<td id="Sx4.T3.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.534</td></tr>
<tr id="Sx4.T3.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="Sx4.T3.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">MV_MCTS+TOOLs (Ours)</td>
